  children's keys (Label form.required, HelpIcon a11y.helpFor) are reproduced as native a11y refinements.
- Tailwind NOT ported — P1/S9 tokens (Color.TS.*, Font.TS.*, TSSpacing, TSRadius.sm, TSMotion.fast).

